  "title": "tls-utils: Move gnutls includes to source file",
  "description": "GnuTLS types and functions aren't used in the tls-utils header\nfile. Move the GnuTLS includes to the source file.\n\nNote that epan/libwireshark doesn't mark the GNUTLS_INCLUDE_DIRS\nas public, unlike libwsutil, so this fixes Stratoshark compilation\non Windows after 8a1a8a594979eb5a4f253c6d43db5a88c2cc6ae8.\n(And more generally fixes plugin includes.)",
